## A note on the images

The ten images under `assets/` are AI-generated (local z-image) and are included as evidence
that the recipe works. Several depict cosplay of characters from published games and manga;
they are here for technical illustration only and imply no affiliation with, or endorsement by,
the rights holders of those characters. Character designs remain the property of their respective
owners; the CC BY 4.0 grant above covers only this repository's own contribution.
